<task id="011" project="spaarkeai-assistant-enhancements-r3">
  <metadata>
    <title>Trim the workspace-state prompt block to {type,label,active} per tab and thread the active-item {id,type,label} handle into the prompt's active-item slot (FR-03, FR-04 server)</title>
    <phase>1 — Awareness (identity + active-item handle)</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>BFF agent-factory change on the ADR-015 prompt privacy boundary (id-not-content); the trim + handle threading is load-bearing governance — code-review + adr-check at Step 9.5.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Sits on the ADR-015 id-not-content prompt boundary and coordinates redesign-r2 PublicContracts seams — judgment-sensitive; the handle must not carry content.</model-tier-reason>
